---
# Titled "Grafana" so it replaces the grafana/base block: this variant runs the
# whole layer in the default namespace rather than observability.
title: Grafana
endpoints:
  - name: OTLP gRPC
    url: localhost:30317
  - name: OTLP HTTP
    url: http://localhost:30318
---
Grafana, Tempo and the collector all run in the `default` namespace.

Browse anonymously, or sign in as admin / admin. The Tempo datasource is already
provisioned, and the collector forwards traces to Tempo. Open Explore to search
them:

  open http://localhost:30300/explore

Send a test trace:

  curl -X POST http://localhost:30318/v1/traces \
    -H 'Content-Type: application/json' \
    -d '{"resourceSpans":[{"resource":{"attributes":[{"key":"service.name","value":{"stringValue":"demo"}}]},"scopeSpans":[{"spans":[{"traceId":"5b8efff798038103d269b633813fc60c","spanId":"eee19b7ec3c1b174","name":"GET /demo","kind":2,"startTimeUnixNano":"1700000000000000000","endTimeUnixNano":"1700000000050000000"}]}]}]}'
